            "body": "The `pre-run-check` failure is due to the contributor gating rule, not a code/test failure:\n\n```\nPR must have the 'verified' or 'ready' (which also triggers tests) label or the author must have at least 4 merged PRs (found 1).\n```\n\nCould a maintainer please add the `ready` or `verified` label when this PR is ready for CI?\n\nI also amended the commit with `Signed-off-by:` to satisfy DCO. Local checks run so far:\n\n```\ngit diff --check -- csrc/cpu/cpu_attn_impl.hpp tests/kernels/attention/test_cpu_attn.py\nuv run --no-project python -m compileall -q tests/kernels/attention/test_cpu_attn.py\n```",
